# Copy to .env.local and paste your own key. `.env.local` is gitignored (*.local).
#
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# WITHOUT this, the app still runs: "Ask Vantage" falls back to a deterministic
# answerer over the help centre content. With it, the assistant is a real
# Gemini call - the only non-simulated AI in the product.
#
# Note the name has NO `VITE_` prefix, and must not gain one. Vite inlines every
# VITE_-prefixed variable into the client bundle, where anyone can read it in
# DevTools. This key is read by the serverless function in `api/gemini.js`
# instead, so it stays on the server and never reaches the browser.
#
# In production, set the same variable in the Vercel project settings rather
# than committing it anywhere.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-3.5-flash.
# Pin a version rather than using `gemini-flash-latest` - the alias moves, and
# older names keep appearing in ListModels long after they stop being callable.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
